  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the berbere spice, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the torn injera bread to the skillet and stir to combine with the spice mixture.",
    "Pour in the pineapple juice and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Serve the fir-fir hot, garnished with additional pineapple juice if desired."
